# CHANAKYA Day / Night & Tier 4 Snapshots (CO-ARCH-007)



Status: **ENTERPRISE APPROVED** · Extends CO-ARCH-003 · Preserves CO-ARCH-005



## Day Mode



Observe · record decisions · monitor SLA / workflow · display certified recommendations.  

**Forbidden:** scoring engines, portfolio intelligence, heavy SQL aggregation on interactive paths.



## Night Mode



Default **02:00** (Admin-configurable). Runs Tier 3 intelligence via EME (Radar + MC snapshots, scores, learning).



## Tier 4



Mission Control and CHANAKYA Radar **consume** certified snapshots only.



## Manual lender selection



Registry read + store lender ID only. No Recommendation / Programme / Policy / Eligibility / AI on select.



